# Week 9 — Pagination, Filtering, Search, Email & Cloudinary

## 🎯 Week Goal

Extend the existing Express + MongoDB API from Week 8 with features that real applications need every day — returning large datasets cleanly, filtering and searching safely, sending emails, and uploading images to the cloud.

By the end of the week, the API should be able to:
- Return paginated, filtered, sorted, and searched user data
- Send welcome and password-reset emails
- Upload, replace, and delete user avatars via Cloudinary

