# 📌 Week 9 Final Outcome

```
USER ACTION
    ↓
CLIENT REQUEST
    ↓
AUTH MIDDLEWARE (JWT check)
    ↓
ROUTE HANDLER
    ↓
SERVICE (business logic)
    ↓
┌──────────────┬──────────────┬────────────────┐
↓              ↓              ↓                ↓
PAGINATION    FILTER       EMAIL           CLOUDINARY
+ SORT        + SEARCH     (Nodemailer)    (Multer)
+ FIELD       (escaped)                    ↓
              ↓              ↓              ↓
         MongoDB       Gmail SMTP      Cloud Storage
              ↓              ↓              ↓
              └──────┬───────┴──────┬───────┘
                     ↓
                JSON RESPONSE
```

